    helpArr: [
      "\u{1F916} <b>kibo</b> \u2014 personal assistant on Cloudflare Workers",
      "",
      "<b>AI Chat</b>",
      "\u2022 just chat \u2014 streaming; the AI can search the web & open pages itself",
      "\u2022 RP format: dialogue in \"double quotes\", actions/narration in *asterisks* (always consistent)",
      "\u2022 /reset \u2014 new chat (history cleared, memory kept)",
      "\u2022 /profile \u2014 level, streak, wallet, shields & today's crate",
      "\u2022 /aistats \u2014 the AI's own stats: per-char bond, memory, game record, wrapped",
      "\u2022 /regenerate \u2014 drop the last answer, the AI rewrites it from scratch (reacting to a bot message with any emoji = same trigger)",
      "\u2022 /continue \u2014 continue an answer cut off by the runtime limit (\u23F1) right from where it stopped",
      "\u2022 /abort \u2014 stop a running AI generation (runaway thinking / stuck)",
      "\u2022 /rewind \u2014 reply a char message: chat rewinds there (later messages deleted, AI history trimmed to it)",
      "\u2022 /delete \u2014 reply any message to remove it from chat + AI context",
      "\u2022 /vibe \u2014 character energy dial: serious/balanced/playful/custom (/vibe alone = view)",
      "\u2022 /outfit \u2014 set the active char's outfit, woven into the story (/outfit alone = view)",
      "\u2022 /plot \u2014 set the story tone mix, e.g. \"60% romance, 30% comedy\" (/plot alone = view)",
      "\u2022 /dice \u2014 story dice: 3 random elements (place/twist/object) to kickstart RP",
      "\u2022 /ooc \u2014 break character: discuss the story out of RP (toggle; /reset returns)",
      "\u2022 /rpreset \u2014 reset every RP knob to default at once (vibe+outfit+plot)",
      "\u2022 /menu \u2014 button panel: every feature lives there",
      "\u2022 send a voice \u2192 you talk, AI replies | photo \u2192 AI sees & replies | article link \u2192 summarized",
      "\u2022 /tts \u2014 toggle voice notes: chat replies \u2264600 chars get spoken (melotts; non-en reads with en accent)",
      "",
      "<b>Journal</b>",
      "\u2022 /j &lt;text&gt; [#mood] \u2014 save entry | /digest \u2014 24h summary",
      "\u2022 auto digest daily at 07:00 WIB when there are entries",
      "",
      "<b>Reminders</b>",
      "\u2022 /remind 2h meds | /remind besok 09:00 meeting | /remind tiap hari 21:00 meds | /remind tiap jumat 19:00 gym",
      "\u2022 /reminds \u2014 list + buttons | /del &lt;id&gt; \u2014 delete | /quest \u2014 daily quest + streak points | /quest reroll & /quest reset \u2014 redo/reset | side quests: just ask your char in chat",
      "\u2022 /game \u2014 point mini-games: Word Guess (5-letter word) + Quick Quiz (3 AI questions) + Lyric Guess (from Last.fm) + Song Quiz (audio) \u2014 1x/day each",
      "\u2022 /dive \u2014 Daily Dive: 7 daily prompts, the rarer your answer the more it scores \u2014 1 run/day + practice",
      "\u2022 /anime &lt;title&gt; / /manga &lt;title&gt; \u2014 anime/manga lookup via Kitsu (the AI can also search it itself)",
      "\u2022 /weather [city] \u2014 weather + char context | /np \u2014 what's playing right now",
      "• /dl &lt;link&gt; — direct download URLs: TikTok / X / Instagram / YouTube (360p instantly, 720p & MP3 via builder)",
      "• /yts &lt;keywords&gt; — search YouTube: numbered results + metadata, tap a number = download menu",
      "• /nh &lt;id&gt; — nhentai gallery as photo album (auto-deletes ~5 min, savable); /nh &lt;id&gt; zip|pdf|scroll for the file",
      "• /song &lt;title&gt; — search a song on YT → instant MP3 · /spotify &lt;link&gt; — MP3 from Spotify",
      "\u2022 each reminder gets an AI reaction; ignore it and it nags at minute 3/6/10, gives up at 15",
      "\u2022 /focus 25 — focus timer +points (using the bot mid-session = caught, session voided!) | /sleep gn/gm — sleep log | /habit — daily or weekly-target habits (/habit add gym 3) | /habit plan &lt;topic&gt; — AI-designed habit program",
      "\u2022 /beli 25k kopi — log an expense | /capsule besok 09:00 &lt;message&gt; — letter to future you",
      "• photo quest: /quest → Photo button — send a photo captioned /pq, vision-verified, +points",
      "",
      "<b>Memory</b>",
      "\u2022 /remember &lt;fact&gt; \u2014 permanent | /mems \u2014 list + buttons | /forget &lt;id&gt;",
      "",
      "<b>Characters</b>",
      "\u2022 /char add &lt;name&gt; | &lt;prompt&gt; \u2014 create a persona card",
      "\u2022 /char import \u2014 upload a SillyTavern card (.json/.png)",
      "\u2022 /char &lt;id|name&gt; \u2014 use | /char off \u2014 default | /char list \u2014 buttons",
      "\u2022 /cmems \u2014 active character's memory | /reset char \u2014 clear its history + memory",
      "",
      "<b>Presets</b>",
      "\u2022 /presets \u2014 simple SillyTavern presets: toggle + import a .json file (enabled ones style the AI's replies)",
      "",
      "<b>2FA (TOTP)</b>",
      "\u2022 /totp add &lt;label&gt; &lt;secret&gt; \u2014 save a 2FA secret (your message is deleted instantly) | /totp \u2014 live codes + countdown",
      "",
      "<b>Your Persona</b>",
      "\u2022 /me &lt;name&gt; | &lt;description&gt; \u2014 set | /me \u2014 view | /me off \u2014 delete",
      "",
      "<b>RSS</b>",
      "\u2022 /rss add &lt;url&gt; \u2014 blogs / YouTube channels | /rss list \u2014 buttons | /rss del &lt;id&gt;",
      "\u2022 checked every 15 minutes, new items get pushed",
      "",
      "<b>Email</b>",
      "\u2022 /otp \u2014 emails from the last 10 minutes (push auto-deletes after 30s, button to reopen)",
      "",
      "<b>Vault</b>",
      "\u2022 /vault \u2014 file manager + backup: a private channel acts as file & snapshot archive",
      "\u2022 /save \u2014 reply to a file/photo/video with /save (or caption /save) to store it",
      "\u2022 /files \u2014 file list (tap = re-receive, delete/rename by number) | /find &lt;word&gt; | /get &lt;name|number&gt; | /rm &lt;name|number&gt;",
      "\u2022 daily auto backup into the vault; /vault \u2192 \u267B\uFE0F Restore to roll back",
      "<b>Settings</b>",
      "\u2022 /model \u2014 AI model (custom wizard: URL \u2192 pick model \u2192 key; or one-shot /model set base|model|key)",
      "\u2022 /len \u2014 reply length: short / medium / long",
      "\u2022 /lang \u2014 AI OUTPUT language (default English; internal reasoning stays English)",
      "\u2022 bot UI language (buttons/descriptions): /menu \u2192 \u2699\uFE0F Settings \u2192 \u{1F5A5}\uFE0F",
      "\u2022 /stats \u2014 AI usage stats (tokens)",
      "\u2022 /sys \u2014 system info: KV, POP, webhook, quota, secrets",
      "",
      "/ping \u2014 health check"
    ],

    dlUsage: "usage: <code>/dl https://post-link</code>\nsupports: TikTok (video/photos/sound) · X/Twitter · Instagram (reels & photos) · Facebook · YouTube (360p instantly · 720p & MP3 through the builder) · Spotify (full-track MP3) · SoundCloud (full track).\nfor YouTube the file is really delivered here (360p instantly, 720p/MP3 rendered first, ~1-2 min).",
